    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch05-09: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.97";
    dc:description "This is a constructive graph-theoretic existence claim and can be settled by explicit finite-description constructions for arbitrary dimension. No empirical coverage problem remains once the intended notion of equivalence is stated.";
