    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For each finite dimension d, encode the integer lattice using vertices with two labeled outgoing edges and a graph construction that represents the required coordinate moves, then exhibit analogous constructions for trees and nested graphs. Verify graph isomorphism to the target structures or identify a degree constraint that makes the construction impossible.";
