    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Equivalent to an array depends on whether edges may encode paths rather than immediate neighbors.", "Two outgoing connections may need labels or directed-path gadgets.";
